The evolution of the digital economy: From human interfaces to infrastructures for autonomous agents. 🤖🌐

We are entering the era of the "Agentic Economy." Thanks to the x402 protocol, AI agents have evolved from simple language models into economic entities with autonomous financial execution capabilities.

   @Base as the Pillar of AI 🔵
  Base is establishing itself as the definitive settlement layer for this new frontier. By providing a scalable and standardized architecture, it allows AI agents to interact and perform complex financial settlements in real-time. It’s not just a network; it’s the financial operating system where AI autonomy lives.

The cryptographic future is being defined today through the total integration of intelligence and capital. Welcome to the era of agents on Base🚀 
